## AI-Assisted

## This repo has no debian/control by design (Windows installer).
## Tell genmkfile to derive the version from the nearest git tag
## rather than parsing debian/changelog, so `genmkfile git-verify`
## works here. See genmkfile/usr/share/genmkfile/shared.bsh and
## make-helper-one.bsh make_get_variables.
##
## shellcheck disable=SC2034 -- consumed by genmkfile after this file
## is sourced; ShellCheck cannot see the cross-file usage.
# shellcheck disable=SC2034
make_use_git_describe_for_version=true
